sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Op as Operator screen
  participant S as Supervisor
  participant F as Fastening
  Note over S,F: Robot is at spot 12, Fastening step.<br/>The drill drives the screw until it reaches the right torque<br/>(limit: 10 seconds).
  S->>F: CMD_START (spot 12)
  F-->>S: FAULT (TORQUE_TIMEOUT), drill retracted
  S->>F: CMD_START (retry 1 of 2, drive screw again)
  F-->>S: FAULT (TORQUE_TIMEOUT), drill retracted
  S->>F: CMD_START (retry 2 of 2, drive screw again)
  F-->>S: FAULT (TORQUE_TIMEOUT), drill retracted
  S->>Op: ALERT: robot stopped. Spot 12, Fastening, TORQUE_TIMEOUT
  Note over S: Stack light turns flashing amber, so the operator sees it from across the roof
  Note over S: Robot waits at spot 12.<br/>Nothing moves.<br/>Operator can watch the live feed.
  alt Operator can fix it
    Op->>S: RESOLVED (fixed on the robot)
    S->>F: CMD_START (resume same step)
    F-->>S: DONE
    Note over S: Spot continues with the next step
  else Operator cannot fix it (last resort)
    Op->>S: SKIP_SPOT
    Note over S: Supervisor logs the spot as skipped, then advances to the next spot
  end
